mailkube dev — the Mailkube CLI

  Send mail, manage scheduled sends, and receive webhooks from your terminal.

USAGE
  mailkube <command> [flags]

SEND
  emails send       Send an email
  scheduled-emails  List, reschedule and cancel scheduled sends

DEVELOP
  webhooks listen   Receive webhook events on your machine
  smtp test         Test SMTP connectivity and credentials

SETUP
  init              Guided first-time setup
  auth login        Store credentials
  config            Manage profiles and settings
  dashboard         Show what is managed in the dashboard, and where
  doctor            Diagnose your environment
  errors explain    Explain a Mailkube error code
  skill             Install the agent skill for coding assistants
  topic             Long-form help topics — run `mailkube topic` to list them
  version           Show the CLI and SDK versions

  Run `mailkube <command> --help` for details.
  Docs: https://docs.mailkube.com/cli
